<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48976" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θορῠβ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>uproarious, turbulent</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				671a
			</span></i>; <i>clamorous</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ῶδες φθέγγεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					632b18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θορυβώδεα ἐνυπνιάζεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>VM</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Poll.
					5.123
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				3.25
			</span></i> (prob.): 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερον, διατίθενται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.656f
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>causing alarm</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ ἵππῳ θ. μηδὲν προσφέρειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.</u>
					9.15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>confusing</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δόξαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Demetr.Lac.
					<u>Herc.</u>
					1696.4
				</span></i>
			.</div>
